/T (The main aim of this project is to develop an efficient and real-time Sign Language Recognition System that can accurately detect hand gestures and convert them into readable text using computer vision and machine learning techniques. The system utilizes MediaPipe for hand landmark detection and a trained neural network model for gesture classification. It is designed to capture real-time input through a webcam, process the gesture data, and display the predicted output instantly)
/E (The main aim of this project is to develop an efficient and real-time Sign Language Recognition System that can accurately detect hand gestures and convert them into readable text using computer vision and machine learning techniques. The system utilizes MediaPipe for hand landmark detection and a trained neural network model for gesture classification. It is designed to capture real-time input through a webcam, process the gesture data, and display the predicted output instantly)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
