564 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 271 0 R
/T (The system design focuses on developing a real-time sign language recognition system that integrates computer vision and machine learning techniques. The system begins with capturing live video input through a webcam, which is processed using OpenCV for frame extraction. MediaPipe is used to detect the hand and extract 21 landmark points representing finger positions.)
/E (The system design focuses on developing a real-time sign language recognition system that integrates computer vision and machine learning techniques. The system begins with capturing live video input through a webcam, which is processed using OpenCV for frame extraction. MediaPipe is used to detect the hand and extract 21 landmark points representing finger positions.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
565 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 271 0 R
/T (The system architecture consists of interconnected modules for real-time gesture recognition. Input is captured through a webcam and processed using MediaPipe for hand landmark detection. The extracted features are fed into a trained model for classification. The predicted gesture is then displayed as text output, ensuring fast and accurate performance.)
/E (The system architecture consists of interconnected modules for real-time gesture recognition. Input is captured through a webcam and processed using MediaPipe for hand landmark detection. The extracted features are fed into a trained model for classification. The predicted gesture is then displayed as text output, ensuring fast and accurate performance.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
