<<
/Title (Earlier systems mainly used image processing techniques and Convolutional Neural Networks \(CNN\) to recognize hand gestures from static images. These methods focused on extracting features such as hand shape, edges, and contours from images. While these systems achieved good accuracy, they required large datasets and high computational power. Additionally, most of these models were limited to offline processing and were not suitable for real-time applications.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1999 0 R
/Prev 2003 0 R
>>
